# lucapette.me

> Personal website of Luca Pette, an independent software developer. The site features blog posts about software engineering, engineering management, programming languages (Go, Ruby, Rust, Kotlin), streaming data systems (Kafka Streams), developer tools (Vim, tmux), book reviews, and personal notes on various topics.

Built with Eleventy (11ty). Content includes blog posts, programming notes, book notes, recipes, and lists.

